# Development Challenges and Engineering Decisions

This document summarizes notable technical problems encountered while developing LotStack, along with their causes, solutions, and resulting design decisions.

## 1. Python Environment and Dependency Management

### Problem

The scraper and ingestion tools initially failed because the required Python environment and packages were not consistently configured.

### Resolution

A project-specific virtual environment and centralized dependency file were added.

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
